Package: vennabers
Title: Venn-Abers Classification and Regression Calibration
Version: 0.8.0
Authors@R: c(person("Venn-Abers", "Authors", role = "aut"),
    person("René-M.", "Kruse", email = "rene.marcel.kruse@protonmail.com", role = "cre"))
Description: Fits binary Inductive and Cross Venn-Abers calibrators from
    caller-supplied probabilities. Returns Inductive Venn-Abers intervals
    and regularized probabilities, or Cross Venn-Abers regularized
    probabilities using equal-weight aggregation across matched folds.
    Supports log-loss or Brier regularization, calibration probability
    rounding, binary class predictions, and individual fold results.
    Supports manual Inductive and Cross multiclass one-vs-one and one-vs-rest calibration
    with named class probabilities and binary diagnostics. Includes binary and multiclass
    Brier score, log loss, and base R calibration plots. Fits moderated
    Inductive and Cross regression calibrators from supplied real-valued
    predictions, returning regression bounds and weighted Inductive point
    predictions or equal-weight means of complete fold results. Optional
    native 'tidymodels' workflows train complete local preprocessing and
    models for binary, one-vs-one, one-vs-rest and regression calibration,
    with Inductive or Cross splits and complete outer resampling.
